@startuml
participant Radar
participant ADAS
participant CAN
participant Brake
participant Body
participant Plant
loop 10 ms step
 CAN -> CAN : advance previous-step frames
 Radar -> ADAS : cached/new 20 Hz measurement
 CAN -> ADAS : previous brake status
 ADAS -> ADAS : validate inputs + feedback; TTC/envelope/FSM
 ADAS -> CAN : request + ADAS status
 CAN -> Brake : previous request
 Brake -> Brake : E2E validate, accept/echo, timeout, arbitration
 Brake -> CAN : status + accepted counter
 CAN -> Body : previous brake + ADAS status
 Body -> Body : lamps, warning, unavailable
 Brake -> Plant : actuator output (then friction limit)
end
note over ADAS,Brake
FI02: dropped commands -> frozen accepted counter/timeout.
ADAS indicates unavailable; current valid threat requests continue.
No alternate actuation path: collision remains possible.
end note
@enduml
